{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"i\": 1,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"“心愿落到实处”被限定为他真正承受自身在乎的事实，而非确认两个人已经相爱；随后由H29、H30、H31、H34及M38、M39解释踏实感为何反而伴随更强的承受压力，没有新增外部事件或改变主线。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 2,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"心疼来自H20所确立的时间意识，以及H27中对方仍在而时间不停的并存压力，M22进一步说明快乐尚未结束便已产生留恋，并未把107小节的音乐变化直接当作心理原因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 3,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"H30解释了站稳感的来源，H34解释了心疼为何无法消退，M42与M43补足了两种感受同时存在的过程，没有添加新的前史或外部事件。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 4,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"“可是呢”的疑问是H2的真实悬念与H12中尚不了解对方心意的状态自然引出的局部心理过程，既没有把未知直接解释成拒绝，也没有否定已经得到的幸福。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"四条都直接交代了当下的感受及其心理原因，时间流逝、深切在乎与对方心意未知之间的关系能够连贯理解，小节和依据编号不影响正文的基本情感逻辑。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "cf7e8b80-859f-40eb-9b46-f8edda99b97b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T144434139237Z", "elapsed_seconds": 358.734, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T14:50:32.883494+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "650d5d2a02ac1b7f3d7502e50caf30d50f185b27ad5d17bdc4ef974fcf632ed0", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_re